index 6cf8ccc..79257aa 100644
--- a/DEPLOY.md
+++ b/DEPLOY.md
@@ -374,3 +374,41 @@ Team members (Telegram linked in BusyBee) can ask the bot to change things. What
 
 `/changes` lists the last changes made through the bot. Nothing extra to configure: the
 database keys you already set are used, and the bot never touches credential tables.
+
+## GQ Technical Analysis (alerts, screens and chart reads on Telegram)
+
+The bot can use the GQ Technical Analysis software: stored technical
+calculations for India, US and global stocks, ETFs and indices. Every number
+comes from the Technical Analysis server; the bot only asks it.
+
+1. Deploy the Technical Analysis server first (see that repo's
+   `docs/DEPLOY.md`). Note its public URL and the `TA_API_SECRET` you chose.
+2. In this service on Railway, Variables, add:
+
+   ```
+   TA_API_URL=https://<technical-analysis-server>.up.railway.app
+   TA_API_SECRET=<the same long random string as on the TA server>
+   TA_APP_URL=https://<technical-analysis-app>.vercel.app
+   ```
+
+   and redeploy. `/ta` in Telegram now answers, and the `ta_*` tools appear.
+3. Each person links once: in the app open **Alerts → Telegram → Get code**,
+   then send the bot `/ta link 123456` in a private chat. After that their
+   alerts, morning summary and task results arrive in this chat, and "my
+   alerts" / "my watchlist" mean their own Technical Analysis account.
+
+The Technical Analysis server SENDS messages with this same bot token
+(`sendMessage` only) and never polls, so it does not conflict with this bot.
+
+The app's agent panel calls `POST /api/chat` on this service, so give this
+service a public domain (Settings → Networking → Generate Domain) and put that
+URL into the TA server's `GQAGENT_URL`.
+
+Things people can ask:
+
+- analyse HDFCBANK / read the weekly chart of Reliance
+- India stocks with weekly MMA bullish and rising RSC vs India
+- how is the Japan market's breadth
+- alert me when TCS weekly RSI crosses above 60
+- tell me when anything in my Core list makes a golden cross
+- every weekday at 8:45 tell me which of my Core list are rising
